    <item>
      <title>DNSBomb: A New Practical-and-Powerful Pulsing DoS Attack Exploiting DNS Queries-and-Responses</title>
      <link>https://lixiang521.com/zh/publication/oakland24-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://lixiang521.com/zh/publication/oakland24-2/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;概述&#34;&gt;概述&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DNSBomb is a new practical and powerful pulsing DoS attack exploiting DNS queries and responses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We concluded that &lt;strong&gt;ANY SYSTEM or MECHANISM&lt;/strong&gt;, which can aggregate &amp;ldquo;things&amp;rdquo;, could be exploited to construct the pulsing DoS traffic, such as DNS and CDN.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please join us to find more if you can! It is very interesting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DNS炸弹: &lt;a href=&#34;https://dnsbomb.net/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;https://dnsbomb.net/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CVE/CNNVD&lt;/strong&gt; (11/4)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2024: 1/3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2023: 10/1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://nlnetlabs.nl/downloads/unbound/CVE-2024-33655.txt&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Industry-wide&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2024-33655&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CVE-2024-33655&lt;/a&gt;(低危) &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CNNVD-202406-457&lt;/a&gt;(低危)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/TechnitiumSoftware/DnsServer/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#version-120&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Technitium&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2023-28456&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CVE-2023-28456&lt;/a&gt;(高危) &lt;a href=&#34;https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2023-49203&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CVE-2023-49203&lt;/a&gt;(高危) &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CNNVD-202409-1742&lt;/a&gt;(高危) &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CNNVD-202409-1740&lt;/a&gt;(高危)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://thekelleys.org.uk/gitweb/?p=dnsmasq.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=eb92fb32b746f2104b0f370b5b295bb8dd4bd5e5&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Dnsmasq&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2023-28450&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CVE-2023-28450&lt;/a&gt;(高危)&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2023-49207&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CVE-2023-49207&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CNNVD-202303-1261&lt;/a&gt;(高危)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.knot-resolver.cz/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Knot&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2023-49206&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CVE-2023-49206&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
